# The benchmark harness IS tracked: lib/sqlite/database.ts and lib/cache/index.ts
# both cite bench/sqlite/FINAL-REPORT.md as the justification for the PRAGMA set
# and the BLOB-over-JSONB choice, and a citation to a path that is not in the
# repository is not evidence. Its generated databases and vendored driver are
# ignored by bench/sqlite/.gitignore; the run output is ignored here because it is
# reproducible from the harness and is host-specific.
bench/sqlite/results/

# Local SQLite databases (rate limits + cache). Never commit these:
# they hold IP addresses and contact destinations as keys.
data/
